WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.156 --> 00:00:12.630
(soft jazz music)

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:13.650
- Hi, I'm Inga.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:16.440
I'm here in Hong Kong, my
hometown, for a couple of days.

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.470
Apparently the fanciest
McDonald's in the world

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:20.240
is right here

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:21.480
in the background.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.560
It's called McDonald's Next.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.010
They say it's amazing, and
it looks super gourmet,

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:26.190
so I'm super excited.

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:29.247
Let's go in and see just how
fancy McDonald's can get.

00:00:29.247 --> 00:00:32.830
(classical ballroom music)

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:04.780
I'm here to order a
little bit of everything

00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:06.540
at this fancy McDonald's.

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:08.030
Let's see how bougie we can get.

00:01:08.030 --> 00:01:10.300
Gonna start with this bakery style bun,

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:13.081
100% angus beef, thick cut,

00:01:13.081 --> 00:01:16.640
mozzarella, lettuce,
tomato, caramelized onion,

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:17.853
Big Mac sauce.

00:01:17.853 --> 00:01:18.686
Truffle.

00:01:18.686 --> 00:01:20.990
(lively jazz music)

00:01:20.990 --> 00:01:22.656
All that good stuff.

00:01:22.656 --> 00:01:23.840
(cash register rings)

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:26.260
California blend, shaved parmesan,

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:28.990
roasted sesame, sweet corn, crouton,

00:01:28.990 --> 00:01:30.730
tomato, quinoa.

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:32.460
They have quinoa.

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:33.293
Chicken.

00:01:33.293 --> 00:01:35.411
This salad's gonna be amazing.

00:01:35.411 --> 00:01:36.474
My God.

00:01:36.474 --> 00:01:37.780
Oh my God.

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:38.613
Who knew you could spend

00:01:38.613 --> 00:01:39.650
this much money at McDonald's.
(cash register rings)

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:42.040
I think we a pretty,

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:43.920
Ooh, McCafe.

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:45.530
Maybe I'll get an iced latte.

00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:48.111
Chocolate sundae waffle cone

00:01:48.111 --> 00:01:49.028
and matcha.

00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:51.270
A mango macaron.

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:54.300
I think that's all I should get.

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:55.650
Let's look at the total order.

00:01:55.650 --> 00:01:58.370
274 dollars.
(cash register rings)

00:01:58.370 --> 00:01:59.411
Let's do it.

00:01:59.411 --> 00:02:01.658
(lively jazz music)

00:02:01.658 --> 00:02:04.380
(gasps) Yeah!

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:05.213
Here we go.

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:09.292
Now we wait for the food to come.

00:02:09.292 --> 00:02:12.625
(energetic swing music)

00:02:14.770 --> 00:02:15.810
Table service.

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:17.800
They just gave me my salad

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:21.890
and then asked if I wanted
the dessert served after.

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:24.670
It's like being at an actual restaurant.

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:27.130
OK, no problem.

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:27.963
Thank you.

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:33.980
Just got the iced cappuccino
and the iced latte.

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:35.310
They look insanely good.

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:36.640
Look at this.

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:38.920
If you put this in a Starbucks
cup and you gave it to me,

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:40.010
I would have thought it was Starbucks.

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:40.980
It's really good.

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:42.300
I'm really surprised.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.910
I think it's like freshly ground coffee.

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:45.310
Oh, sheet!

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:47.170
Premium coffee beans.

00:02:47.170 --> 00:02:50.210
McDonald's has their own coffee beans.

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:52.930
That is insane.

00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:54.970
Gonna check this salad out.

00:02:54.970 --> 00:02:55.845
And this is what it looks like.

00:02:55.845 --> 00:02:58.678
(soft jazz music)

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:05.970
The grilled chicken,
croutons, the crayfish mayo,

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:09.329
tomatoes, shaved
parmesan, quinoa couscous.

00:03:09.329 --> 00:03:12.593
Gonna put this sesame dressing on.

00:03:12.593 --> 00:03:15.465
(soft jazz music)

00:03:15.465 --> 00:03:16.298
Yaaass.

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:20.020
I really like it.

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:21.350
Not normally a salad person,

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:22.750
but this salad I would totally eat.

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:23.806
Oh, the bacon.

00:03:23.806 --> 00:03:25.960
The crayfish is really good.

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:28.670
I thought it would be like
imitation crab meat or something.

00:03:28.670 --> 00:03:29.994
No, it's actual crayfish.

00:03:29.994 --> 00:03:32.827
(soft jazz music)

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:35.870
Gee, that is amazing.

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:37.800
When you customize your
own salad at whole foods,

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:39.160
that's what it tastes like.

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:40.620
Everything is really fresh.

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.220
You can pick what you like.

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:43.053
It's amazing.

00:03:44.822 --> 00:03:45.655
Sorry, this is really good.

00:03:45.655 --> 00:03:47.149
Let me get another bite.

00:03:47.149 --> 00:03:48.280
(giggles) I really like it.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:49.530
I just got the burger.

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:52.261
It looks so good (gasps.)

00:03:52.261 --> 00:03:55.261
(lively jazz music)

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:58.020
That's a huge burger.

00:03:58.020 --> 00:03:59.330
Look at all those layers.

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:01.220
McDonald's fries just
stepped up their game.

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:03.090
And we have actual silverware.

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:03.923
That's not plastic.

00:04:03.923 --> 00:04:06.460
It's metal, like you would
see at an actual restaurant.

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:07.940
If I told you this was from McDonald's,

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:08.773
you would not believe me.

00:04:08.773 --> 00:04:10.180
We're not talking normal patties.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:13.090
This is like double the
thickness of normal patties.

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:13.926
Let's go for it.

00:04:13.926 --> 00:04:16.090
(lively jazz music)

00:04:16.090 --> 00:04:20.250
You can actually see the meat in there.

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:22.350
Big Mac sauce and truffle sauce together.

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:23.183
(bomb blasts)

00:04:23.183 --> 00:04:24.350
Mind blown.

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:25.340
It is so good.

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:27.440
It's so good!

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:29.280
Who would have ever thought

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:31.340
that McDonald's sells truffle sauce.

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:32.980
I think I was a little bit skeptical,

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:34.860
but this actually tastes really good.

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:37.120
I would totally order this again.

00:04:39.611 --> 00:04:41.119
Holy shit!

00:04:41.119 --> 00:04:42.800
Well, it still looks
like an ice cream, right?

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:45.562
This is the chocolate waffle cone.

00:04:45.562 --> 00:04:47.777
The texture of this ice
cream is very much like

00:04:47.777 --> 00:04:49.640
their normal soft serve

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:53.050
but the waffle cone is super buttery.

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:54.130
It is super nice.

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:56.750
I got myself a matcha parfait.

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:58.520
Vanilla ice cream on top,

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:00.495
and then I think there's chocolate bits.

00:05:00.495 --> 00:05:04.010
(soft jazz music)

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:05.857
The matcha smells really good.

00:05:05.857 --> 00:05:08.690
(soft jazz music)

00:05:10.398 --> 00:05:11.770
Oh my God.

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:12.603
Let's do this.

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:16.870
It blends together really, really well.

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:19.080
I can't believe that
this is from McDonald's.

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:22.600
Mango macaron at McDonald's.

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:25.740
It's not absolutely amazing,

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:27.030
but it's not bad.

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:29.050
I'm really impressed, McDonald's.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:31.453
Now that we had burgers and salads,

00:05:31.453 --> 00:05:33.310
and coffees and desserts,

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:34.680
I think this is the perfect way

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:39.110
to finish off a fancy McDonald's
meal here in Hong Kong.

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:44.200
Thank you, McDonald's, for showing me that

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:46.732
even fast food can be really fancy.

00:05:46.732 --> 00:05:50.149
(upbeat acoustic music)

